#include "hshs46.dtsi"

&kscan0 {
    compatible = "zmk,kscan-mock";
    exit-after = <0>;
};
```

Make sure the file ends after the closing `};` with nothing else after it — no backticks, no extra text.

4. Then check `hshs46_dongle.conf` the same way — it should contain **only** these four lines:
```
CONFIG_ZMK_SPLIT=y
CONFIG_ZMK_SPLIT_ROLE_CENTRAL=y
CONFIG_ZMK_USB=y
CONFIG_BT_CTLR_TX_PWR_PLUS_8=y
